  "question": {
    "text": "Two straight roads <math><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;intersect at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math>. A tower is situated within the angle formed by them and subtends angles of <math><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math> at the points <math><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> where the roads are nearest to it. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>, then the height of the tower is"
  },
